WEBVTT

c1
00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:01.260
This is Agent Aisle,

c2
00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:02.180
in a minute.

c3
00:00:02.997 --> 00:00:04.407
Audit Agent Skills before

c4
00:00:04.407 --> 00:00:04.847
you trust them.

c5
00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:06.753
A skill is a

c6
00:00:06.753 --> 00:00:07.793
folder that contains a

c7
00:00:07.793 --> 00:00:10.383
file called SKILL.md.

c8
00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:11.560
Skills live in

c9
00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:13.480
many GitHub repositories.

c10
00:00:13.895 --> 00:00:14.795
Agent Aisle gives you

c11
00:00:14.795 --> 00:00:15.895
one place to find,

c12
00:00:15.895 --> 00:00:17.595
compare and install them.

c13
00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:19.520
Open a terminal in

c14
00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.120
