c15
00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:22.870
Install a skill.

c16
00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:24.420
This needs no setup,

c17
00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.120
npx downloads and runs

c18
00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:27.380
